{"seq":1,"slug":"commission-fee-types","title":"佣金/订阅/上架/支付/物流费：平台收费类型与计算基数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-fee-commission-strategy/fee-structure/commission-fee-types","wordCount":2587,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"佣金-订阅-上架-支付-物流费-平台收费类型与计算基数\">佣金/订阅/上架/支付/物流费：平台收费类型与计算基数</h1><p>一个商家在平台上经营一个月，被扣的钱可能来自六个互不相关的计费系统：成交时被抽走的佣金、月初扣掉的店铺订阅费、为每个在售 SKU 付的上架费、从收款里扣掉的支付通道费、使用平台仓配产生的履约费、以及投广告花掉的推广费。这六笔钱如果只以&quot;平台费用合计&quot;的形式出现在账单上，商家就无法判断哪一项是可变成本、哪一项是固定成本，也就无法做任何经营决策。本文要建立的是这套收费的分类学，以及每一类费用在计算时<strong>以什么为基数</strong>——后者是全部费率设计里争议最集中的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-六类费用的性质划分\">核心概念：六类费用的性质划分</h2><p>把平台收的钱分成六类，依据不是&quot;收的时候叫什么名字&quot;，而是三个可判定的属性：<strong>计费触发点</strong>（什么事件导致这笔费用产生）、<strong>计费基数</strong>（乘上费率的那个量）、以及<strong>经济性质</strong>（这是平台的净收入，还是平台替第三方代收并转付的成本）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>费用类型</th>\n<th>触发点</th>\n<th>计费基数</th>\n<th>经济性质</th>\n<th>典型计价形式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>佣金</td>\n<td>订单成交/结算</td>\n<td>交易额（口径见下）</td>\n<td>平台净收入</td>\n<td>基数 × 比率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订阅费</td>\n<td>周期边界（月/年）</td>\n<td>店铺数或档位</td>\n<td>平台净收入</td>\n<td>定额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上架费</td>\n<td>商品发布</td>\n<td>在售 SKU 数（按月快照）</td>\n<td>平台净收入</td>\n<td>每件定额</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付通道费</td>\n<td>收款成功</td>\n<td>实收金额</td>\n<td>成本转嫁</td>\n<td>比率 + 固定笔费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物流履约费</td>\n<td>出库/妥投</td>\n<td>重量 × 体积 × 距离区间</td>\n<td>成本分摊</td>\n<td>分段定价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广告推广费</td>\n<td>曝光/点击/成交</td>\n<td>竞价结果</td>\n<td>平台净收入</td>\n<td>竞价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表最重要的一列是&quot;经济性质&quot;。<strong>佣金、订阅费、上架费、广告费是平台的收入；支付通道费与物流履约费本质是成本转嫁或成本分摊。</strong> 平台把通道费按自己的成本收给商家时，它在会计上更接近代收代付而不是收入确认——如果把它算进&quot;平台费率&quot;对外沟通，商家会认为平台在涨价，而平台实际上只是把收单机构的费用过了一遍。许多费率沟通事故的根因就在这里：把一个第三方成本项和平台自营收入项合并成&quot;综合费率 18%&quot;，对外一说就再也拆不开了。</p>\n<p>判断某类费用该归哪一边，有一个操作性很强的检验：<strong>如果平台明天改用它自己的成本结构去优化这一项（例如换一家收单机构、改用更便宜的自建仓），这笔费用会变吗？</strong> 会变的是成本项，不会变的是收入项。佣金不会因为平台换了收单机构而变化，通道费会。</p>\n<p>二部制（two-part tariff）是理解订阅费与佣金为何并存的钥匙。一个只收佣金的平台，其收入完全随 GMV 波动；一个只收订阅费的平台，则对商家的成交规模完全不敏感，商家做大后反而会逃离。二者结合构成一条&quot;入场费 + 使用费&quot;的曲线：订阅费覆盖每个商家的固定服务成本（店铺、客服、基础工具），佣金覆盖可变服务成本与平台利润。从定价理论看，二部制让平台能在不放弃低交易量商家的前提下，从高交易量商家那里取得更多剩余——这正是后文<a href=\"tiered-commission\">分层佣金</a>要深化的方向。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[商家在平台上的活动] --&gt; B{产生什么事件}&#10;    B --&gt;|成交| C[佣金: 基数 x 比率]&#10;    B --&gt;|周期到达| D[订阅费: 定额]&#10;    B --&gt;|商品发布| E[上架费: 按件]&#10;    B --&gt;|收款成功| F[通道费: 比率+固定笔费]&#10;    B --&gt;|出库妥投| G[履约费: 分段定价]&#10;    B --&gt;|广告曝光| H[推广费: 竞价]&#10;    C --&gt; I[平台收入]&#10;    D --&gt; I&#10;    E --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I&#10;    F --&gt; J[成本转嫁/代收付]&#10;    G --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; K[平台毛利]&#10;    J --&gt; L[转付第三方或冲减成本]\">graph TD\n    A[商家在平台上的活动] --&gt; B{产生什么事件}\n    B --&gt;|成交| C[佣金: 基数 x 比率]\n    B --&gt;|周期到达| D[订阅费: 定额]\n    B --&gt;|商品发布| E[上架费: 按件]\n    B --&gt;|收款成功| F[通道费: 比率+固定笔费]\n    B --&gt;|出库妥投| G[履约费: 分段定价]\n    B --&gt;|广告曝光| H[推广费: 竞价]\n    C --&gt; I[平台收入]\n    D --&gt; I\n    E --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I\n    F --&gt; J[成本转嫁/代收付]\n    G --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; K[平台毛利]\n    J --&gt; L[转付第三方或冲减成本]</pre><h2 id=\"佣金基数的四种口径\">佣金基数的四种口径</h2><p>佣金是这六类里唯一以交易额为基数的，而&quot;交易额&quot;至少有四种含义。同一个比率乘上不同的基数，结果差异可以超过 15%，所以<strong>基数口径必须在合同与系统里同时显式声明</strong>。</p>\n<p>设商品金额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span>、运费为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、代扣税费为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>、商家自设折扣为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>、平台补贴为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，四种常见基数分别是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>商品金额口径</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = g - d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>。只对商品成交额抽佣，运费与税费都不参与。对商家最友好，跨境场景中商家普遍要求这一口径，因为国际运费里含有平台加价，再抽一次等于双重收费。</li>\n<li><strong>含运费口径</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = g + s - d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>。运费参与抽佣。适用于平台深度参与履约、运费由平台提供的场景——此时运费本身也是平台的服务收入。</li>\n<li><strong>扣税净额口径</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = g + s - t - d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>。把税费排除在基数外。财务上最说得通：税费是代收代缴、不是平台营收，对它抽佣在利润表上无法解释。</li>\n<li><strong>实收口径</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = A_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，即渠道实收金额。最激进，会把支付通道的价差也纳入抽佣范围。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>平台补贴 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的处理是另一个独立问题：平台出钱补贴用户时，商家的货款不该减少，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不进基数；商家自己出资的折扣 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 则应从基数中扣除。若把两者混为一谈，就会出现&quot;平台请客、商家买单&quot;的隐蔽抽佣——这类问题在<a href=\"../fee-strategy/fee-change-impact\">费率变更影响评估</a>中会以&quot;有效费率与名义费率背离&quot;的形式暴露。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基数口径</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>商家接受度</th>\n<th>平台收入</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>商品金额</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g - d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>商家自履约、跨境轻小件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含运费</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g + s - d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>平台提供履约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扣税净额</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g + s - t - d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>多税辖区、代扣税场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>渠道实收</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>平台承担全部通道成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"定额类费用的设计约束\">定额类费用的设计约束</h2><p>订阅费与上架费都是定额，但它们的约束完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>订阅费</strong>的关键量是档位数与每档包含的服务边界。档位太多会让商家难以自评、也会让销售团队的解释成本上升；档位太少则无法体现差异。工程上订阅费真正的难点不在定价，而在<strong>状态机</strong>：店铺在什么时刻从&quot;试用&quot;转&quot;付费&quot;、欠费到什么程度暂停服务、降档时已付周期的余量如何折算。这些状态转换必须与商家可见的权限严格同步，否则会出现&quot;已经降档但仍在使用高级功能&quot;的越权访问——这是把计费系统与权限系统耦合在一起的地方，任何一侧单独改都会破坏契约。</p>\n<p><strong>上架费</strong>的关键量是<strong>计费快照时点</strong>。如果按&quot;当前在售数量&quot;实时计费，商家在大促期间临时上架又会立刻下架，费用无法结算；如果按周期快照，必须明确快照是月初、月末还是周期内最大值。用最大值会激励商家在快照日之外集中上架（规避行为），用平均值则要求系统持续采样。多数平台选择&quot;周期内日终最大值&quot;并把规则写进合同，因为它的激励结构最简单：想少付费就少上架，没有时间窗口可以钻。</p>\n<p>上架费还有一个容易忽略的作用：<strong>它是供给质量的过滤器</strong>。免费无限上架会带来海量低质重复 SKU，污染搜索与推荐；一个很小的上架费（例如每件每月几美分）就能显著抑制&quot;广撒网&quot;行为，同时对认真经营的商家几乎不构成负担——这正是<a href=\"../fee-strategy/fee-incentive-category\">重点品类费率扶持</a>中对新品类豁免上架费的逻辑起点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本转嫁类费用的透明边界\">成本转嫁类费用的透明边界</h2><p>支付通道费与物流履约费是平台最不该作为利润中心的两类费用，原因不是道德，而是<strong>商业上不可持续</strong>：它们可被第三方直接比价，一旦平台在这上面加价过多，商家会立刻转向自建或第三方服务，而平台失去了对交易与数据的绑定。</p>\n<p>通道费的定价结构通常是&quot;比率 + 固定笔费&quot;：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = A_{\\text{total}} \\times r_p + c_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。固定笔费 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的存在意味着低客单价订单的实际费率远高于名义费率。一笔 3 美元的订单被收 0.30 美元固定费，等效费率是 10%，而这与&quot;交易金额无关&quot;的表述在直觉上冲突。因此<strong>通道费的对外披露必须同时给出比率与固定笔费，并且对小额订单做示例说明</strong>——这一要求在第四章的<a href=\"../fee-transparency/fee-breakdown-show\">账单明细透明展示</a>中会被展开成具体的展示方案。</p>\n<p>履约费的分段定价（按重量区间、体积重、距离分区）在工程上要求一个可解释的<strong>计费重量</strong>定义：是实重、体积重，还是两者取大。跨境场景中体积重的换算系数（例如每 5000 立方厘米折 1 公斤）本身就是一个费率参数，它属于费率政策的一部分，应当纳入<a href=\"../fee-policy-config/fee-rule-engine\">费率规则引擎</a>统一管理，而不是散落在物流系统里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>平台收费至少分六类，划分依据是触发点、基数与经济性质，而不是名字。</li>\n<li>佣金、订阅、上架、广告是平台收入；通道费与履约费是成本转嫁，混入&quot;综合费率&quot;会造成沟通事故。</li>\n<li>佣金基数有四种口径，同一比率下结果差异可超 15%，必须在合同与系统中同时显式声明；平台补贴不进基数，商家折扣进基数。</li>\n<li>二部制（订阅 + 佣金）是平台在不放弃小商家的同时从大商家取得更多剩余的基本结构。</li>\n<li>订阅费的设计难点是状态机与权限同步，上架费的设计难点是快照时点与规避激励。</li>\n<li>成本转嫁类费用不得作为利润中心，且必须披露固定笔费与计费重量这类&quot;看起来无关&quot;的参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[收费类型] --&gt; B[按交易额]&#10;    A --&gt; C[按时间]&#10;    A --&gt; D[按数量]&#10;    A --&gt; E[按用量]&#10;    B --&gt; F[佣金]&#10;    C --&gt; G[订阅费]&#10;    D --&gt; H[上架费]&#10;    E --&gt; I[通道费/履约费/广告费]\">graph TD\n    A[收费类型] --&gt; B[按交易额]\n    A --&gt; C[按时间]\n    A --&gt; D[按数量]\n    A --&gt; E[按用量]\n    B --&gt; F[佣金]\n    C --&gt; G[订阅费]\n    D --&gt; H[上架费]\n    E --&gt; I[通道费/履约费/广告费]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"佣金/订阅/上架/支付/物流费：平台收费类型与计算基数","id":"佣金-订阅-上架-支付-物流费-平台收费类型与计算基数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：六类费用的性质划分","id":"核心概念-六类费用的性质划分"},{"level":2,"text":"佣金基数的四种口径","id":"佣金基数的四种口径"},{"level":2,"text":"定额类费用的设计约束","id":"定额类费用的设计约束"},{"level":2,"text":"成本转嫁类费用的透明边界","id":"成本转嫁类费用的透明边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"按品类/市场差异化费率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-fee-commission-strategy/fee-structure/category-market-rate"}}